OL,3,GNEWSACounty council to step back from
OL,4,Arefugee role
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire County Council is to
OL,7,Fwithdraw from its role as the
OL,8,Fcoordinating authority helping Afghan
OL,9,Frefugees find homes across the county.
OL,11,FIt said it will notify the Home Office
OL,12,Fand transfer responsibility by March
OL,13,Fnext year.
OL,15,FReform's Joshua Roberts, cabinet member
OL,16,Ffor rural affairs, environment and
OL,17,Fcommunities, said the cabinet had
OL,18,F"carefully considered the options
OL,19,Favailable" and agreed to "step back".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
